51	 * recorded rationale, the terminal replaying the recorded steps, then the clean-container tiles
52	 * and the verdict. One window acts at a time; the others dim. Loops after a pause when asked, or
53	 * replays once on mouse hover after it finishes; under reduced motion it shows the final state.
